OL,3,GNEWSAMayor backs #1bn battery-electric
OL,4,Atrain project
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull and East Yorkshire Mayor Luke
OL,7,FCampbell said the new electric trains
OL,8,Fwere a "better option" than rail
OL,9,Felectrification and Hull West and
OL,10,FHaltemprice MP Emma Hardy said they
OL,11,Fwould be "brilliant".
